==Danish==
[[File:Åbningstider, Stadsbiblioteket i Lyngby, 2016-04-17.JPG|thumb|"Mandag". Opening hours for a Danish library displayed on a window with "Mandag" near the top.]]

===Etymology===
From {{der|da|gmq-oda|mandagh}}, from {{der|da|non|mánadagr}}, from late {{der|da|gem-pro|*mēniniz dagaz}}, a calque of Latin {{m|la|dies lunae}}. Compare {{cog|nb|mandag}}, Swedish and {{cog|nn|måndag}}, {{cog|is|mánudagur}}, {{cog|fo|mánadagur}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmanˀda/|lang=da}}
* {{rhymes|a|lang=da}}

===Noun===
{{da-noun|en|e}}

# [[Monday]]

